From: Robert Christie <rgcgeog@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 14:49:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(gpgpu): growable GPUReadbackRing slots and partial-range
 ticket reads

growable: true lets acquire({byteLength}) / tryAcquire({byteLength}) reserve a slot that holds the request, replacing an idle slot that is too small. GPUReadbackTicket.readPartial() maps a header first and then only the used prefix of a capacity-sized copy.
